{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 29, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler to the land of the rising sun! A journey most grand awaits thee a tapestry of sights and sounds beyond compare.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Kyoto a City of Ancient Grace**\n\nUpon thy arrival at Kansai International Airport a vessel of steel and glass I shall lead thee hence. To Kyoto we journey a city steeped in history and beauty. First visit Fushimi Inari Shrine a path of vermilion gates winding up the mountain a spectacle to behold. Then wander through Gion the geisha district where whispers of elegance linger in the air. Dine upon exquisite Kaiseki a feast for the senses a culinary poem.\n\n**Day Two: Temples and Gardens a Realm of Tranquility**\n\nTo Kinkaku-ji the Golden Pavilion we shall proceed a shimmering mirage reflected in the pond's still waters. Next explore Ryoan-ji Temple's Zen garden a contemplation of stone and sand a place to find inner peace.  Afternoon spent at Arashiyama Bamboo Grove a verdant cathedral swaying gently in the breeze.  A traditional tea ceremony shall be held a ritual of grace and refinement.\n\n**Day Three: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nA pilgrimage to Nara is next our quest.  Here friendly deer roam freely a joyful sight. Visit Todai-ji Temple home to a colossal bronze Buddha a monument to faith and power.  Explore Kasuga Taisha Shrine a treasure trove of lanterns a celestial glow upon the grounds.  Enjoy a delectable mochi a sweet rice cake a taste of Japanese delight.\n\n**Day Four: Hakone's Beauty a Mountain Retreat**\n\nTo Hakone we fare a mountain resort town of unparalleled charm. Cruise across Lake Ashi surrounded by verdant hills and majestic peaks.  Ascend Mount Hakone for panoramic views a vista that stretches to the horizon.  Visit the Hakone Open-Air Museum a collection of sculptures set against the backdrop of nature.  A soak in an onsen a natural hot spring a balm for weary bones.\n\n**Day Five: Tokyo's Metropolis a City of Lights**\n\nFrom Hakone to Tokyo a vibrant city of a thousand wonders. Explore Shibuya Crossing the world's busiest intersection a spectacle of organized chaos. Visit the Imperial Palace East Garden a glimpse into the heart of the Emperor's domain.  Wander through the vibrant streets of Shinjuku a neon-lit wonderland.  Ascend the Tokyo Skytree for unparalleled city views.\n\n**Day Six: Culture and Cuisine a Feast for the Soul**\n\nImmerse thyself in the electric atmosphere of Akihabara the electric town.  Explore the Tsukiji Outer Market a sensory explosion of seafood and delicacies.  Attend a Sumo wrestling match a display of strength and tradition.  Indulge in ramen a noodle soup a comforting and flavorful dish.  \n\n**Day Seven: Departure a Farewell to Wonder**\n\nWith heavy hearts we bid thee farewell to this land of beauty and grace.  Return to Narita or Haneda Airport for thy journey homeward.  Carry with thee the memories of Japan a treasure to cherish forever.  Go forth and tell of thy wondrous travels a tale to be told for ages hence.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0029929152224212885}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3232143828645349e-05}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -0.5038262605667114}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.009203154593706131}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.12421202659606934}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -1.0886099338531494}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -0.39954814314842224}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.00018594920402392745}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.01606801524758339}, {"token": "▁rising", "logprob": -0.13459783792495728}, {"token": "▁sun", "logprob": -0.00011967896716669202}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -0.1950424313545227}, {"token": "▁A", "logprob": -0.17457856237888336}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.0690489113330841}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.5055989027023315}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.20944136381149292}, {"token": "▁awaits", 